:: WM_Lv2_Pickups
<%=window.gm.printPickup()%>
<%if(window.story.state.vars.WM_Lv.qLocUnlock==window.passage.name){%>
    <p>Some sharp knife is stashed away that would possibly useful to cut your restraints.</p>
    <%if(window.story.state.vars.WM_Lv.qRestrainWrist>=2){%>
    <a0 onclick='window.story.state.tmp.args[1]="qRestrainWrist";window.story.show("WM_Lv2_RemoveRestrain")'>Cut your wrist restriants</a>
    <%}%>
<%}%>
<%if(window.story.state.vars.WM_Lv.qLocKey1==window.passage.name){%>
    <p>There is a clipboard lying on the desk with some report attached to it. </p>
    <%if(window.story.state.vars.WM_Lv.qKey1==0){%>
    <div id='selectidx' > This seems to be one of the clue you were looking for.
    <a0 onclick='window.gm.printTalkLink($("div#selectidx")[0],"div#choiceidxa"),window.story.state.vars.WM_Lv.qKey1=1'>Take it</a>
    </div><div id='choiceidxa' hidden>
    </div>
    <%}%>
<%}else if(window.story.state.vars.WM_Lv.qLocKey2==window.passage.name){%>
    <p>A PC is seated on a office desk.  </p>
    <%if(window.story.state.vars.WM_Lv.qKey2==0){%>
    <div id='selectidx' > 
    <a0 onclick='window.gm.printTalkLink($("div#selectidx")[0],"div#choiceidxa"),window.story.state.vars.WM_Lv.qKey2=1'>Copy the confidental files to the USB-drive.</a>
    </div><div id='choiceidxa' hidden>
    </div>
    <%}%>
<%}else if(window.story.state.vars.WM_Lv.qLocKey3==window.passage.name){%>
    <p>On the side of a cabinet a sticky note catches your eye. Something like a passcode is scribbled down on it.</p>
    <%if(window.story.state.vars.WM_Lv.qKey3==0){%>
    <div id='selectidx' > 
    <a0 onclick='window.gm.printTalkLink($("div#selectidx")[0],"div#choiceidxa"),window.story.state.vars.WM_Lv.qKey3=1'>Memorize the code.</a>
    </div><div id='choiceidxa' hidden>
    </div>
    <%}%>
<%}%>

:: WM_Lv2_MAP [_back_]
<section><aside id="sidebar"></aside><article><%=window.story.render("CenterDialogs")%>
TODO
[[Back|_back_]]
</article><article id="LogPanel"></article></section>
<%=window.story.render("WM_Lv1_Encounters")%>

:: WM_Lv2_VixenNurse
<section><aside id="sidebar"></aside><article><%=window.story.render("CenterDialogs")%>
<%=window.story.render("WM_Lv1_RollDebug")%>
<p>A scantyly clad nurse is crossing your path.</p>
<%if(window.story.state.vars.qLowerWear>0){ %>
<p>"Hey baby, everything fine with you?" she asks.</p>
<%}else{%>
<p>Grinning at your sight of your nude crotch she says "I see you are in dire need of attention.." and quickly grabs you by your wrist.</p>
<p>...</p>
<p>Arousal +25</p><%window.story.state.vars.qArousal+=25;%>
<%}%>
<a0 onclick='window.story.show(window.gm.player.location)'>Next</a>
</article><article id="LogPanel"></article></section>


:: WM_Lv2_Orderly
<section><aside id="sidebar"></aside><article><%=window.story.render("CenterDialogs")%>
<%=window.story.render("WM_Lv1_RollDebug")%>
<p>Just as you pass a corner you run into a orderly.</p>
<%if(window.story.state.vars.qUpperWear<=0 && window.story.state.vars.WM_Lv.qRestrainWrist<=0){ window.story.state.vars.WM_Lv.qRestrainWrist=2;%>
<p>He fits some wrist/harness/collar on you. Find a way to remove them before you are bound completely </p>
<p>Arousal +25</p><%window.story.state.vars.qArousal+=25;%>
<%}else if(window.story.state.vars.qLowerWear<=0 && window.story.state.vars.WM_Lv.qRestrainAncle<=0){ window.story.state.vars.WM_Lv.qRestrainAncle=2; %>
<p>He fits some ancles/legbinder on you. Find a way to remove them before you are bound completely </p>
<p>Arousal +25</p><%window.story.state.vars.qArousal+=25;%>
<%}else if(window.story.state.vars.qUpperWear==1){ window.story.state.vars.qUpperWear=0;%>
<p>He rips off your top!</p>
<%}else if(window.story.state.vars.qLowerWear==1){window.story.state.vars.qLowerWear=0;%>
<p>He strips your bottoms!</p>
<%}else{%>
<p>"Lets have some fun you and me." he growls.</p>
<p>Arousal +25</p><%window.story.state.vars.qArousal+=25;%>
<%}%>
<a0 onclick='window.story.show(window.gm.player.location)'>Next</a>
</article><article id="LogPanel"></article></section>


