<a0 onclick='window.story.show(window.gm.player.location)'>Next</a>
</article><article id="LogPanel"></article></section>


:: WM_Lv2_RemoveRestrain
<section><aside id="sidebar"></aside><article><%=window.story.render("CenterDialogs")%>
<p>With the sharp tool you try to remove one of your retraints. </p>
<%window.story.state.vars.WM_Lv[window.story.state.tmp.args[1]]=0;%>
<p>Unfortunatly the tool is now rendered useless.</p>
<a0 onclick='window.story.show(window.gm.player.location)'>Next</a>
</article><article id="LogPanel"></article></section>
<script>function foo(){
    let s=window.story.state,_rooms;
    if(window.story.state.tmp.args[1]=="") return;
    s.vars.WM_Lv[window.story.state.tmp.args[1]]=0;
    _rooms=Object.keys(s.vars.WM_Lv.qLocUnlocks);
    qLocUnlock=_rooms[_.random(0,_rooms.length-1)]; //teleport tool to other location
}
foo();
</script>


:: WM_Lv2_Entry
<section><aside id="sidebar"></aside><article><%=window.story.render("CenterDialogs")%>
<%window.gm.player.location=window.passage.name;%>
<p>Something odd is going on in the hospital. Look around and search for clues. If you have found 3 of them, leave the place through the lobby.</p>
[[Walk into the hospital|WM_Lv2_A1]]
</article><article id="LogPanel"></article></section>

:: WM_Lv2_Exit
<section><aside id="sidebar"></aside><article><%=window.story.render("CenterDialogs")%>
<%window.gm.player.location=window.passage.name;%>
<p>Lets see what you found so far:</p>
<p>[[Next|WM_Home]]</p>
</article><article id="LogPanel"></article></section>


:: WM_Lv2_A1 [name:Lobby]
<section><aside id="sidebar"></aside><article><%=window.story.render("CenterDialogs")%>
<%window.gm.player.location=window.passage.name;%>
<p>This is the lobby of the hospital.</p>
<%if(window.story.state.vars.WM_Lv.Explored[window.passage.name]>=3){%>
<p>You explored all corners of this area.</p>
<%}else{%>
<p>There are still some corners that you could <a0 onclick="window.gm.triggerExploreEvt(window.passage.name)">take a peek</a> into. <p>
<%}%>
<%if((window.story.state.vars.WM_Lv.qKey1==0)||(window.story.state.vars.WM_Lv.qKey2==0)||(window.story.state.vars.WM_Lv.qKey3==0)){%>
<p>As you still have not discovered enough clues you may not leave this place.</p>
<%}else{%>
<p>You have discovered enough clues and may [[leave this place|WM_Lv2_Exit]].</p>
<%}%>
<%=window.story.render("WM_Lv1_Debug")%>
<%=window.story.render("WM_Lv2_Pickups")%>
<a0 onclick='window.gm.triggerExploreEvt("WM_Lv2_B1")'>go to Mensa</a> <a0 onclick='window.gm.triggerExploreEvt("WM_Lv2_N1")'>descend stairs</a>
</article><article id="LogPanel"></article></section>
<%=window.story.render("WM_Lv1_Encounters")%>


